      "source": [
        "The indented line belongs to the loop. These notes use loops only when they are helpful for plotting or comparing models.\n",
        "\n",
        "### `if` and `for`\n",
        "\n",
        "The logic of `if` statements and `for` loops is straightforward. When using it please pay attention to indentations.\n"
